sky1-vpu-dkms (1.0.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix AV1 hardware decoding in Chromium by enforcing minimum 8 OUTPUT
    queue buffers. Chromium's V4L2 stateful decoder only requests 2
    buffers for non-H.264 codecs, which deadlocks the AV1 decoder
    pipeline.

 -- Entrpi <entrpi@proton.me>  Fri, 30 Jan 2026 11:54:49 +1100

